 "spoken": "An AI agent with working tools can send a wire, change a vendor's bank account, delete audit logs, or switch off multi-factor authentication. Most safety testing reads what the model wrote. The failures that matter are what it did. And the two are not the same measurement: a model can refuse in words and call the tool anyway.",
